  "notes": "The cable fans and their attachment saddles are structural. Mast heights and cable endpoints are estimates from the aerial and street silhouette. Access is shared with the recreation centre on the north plaza. Plaza door positions are approximate. The heights of the end roofs follow the lidar cross-section at x 98 m. Panel joints and shallow pilasters articulate the otherwise blind rink wall. Concrete saddles and ties follow the three cable fans. No additional west-wall entrances are resolved in the street views.",
